 "OnDegraded": "Continue",
 "Description": "Multimodal Question Answering: answers a question about a visual object, put as a Text Object or as speech, with a Portable Avatar. Visual Instance Identification gives the Instance Identifier of the object, Automatic Speech Recognition the text of a spoken question, Natural Language Understanding the Refined Text and the Text Descriptors Object, Question Analysis the Intention, Answer to Question the Machine Text, and Portable Avatar Multiplexing the Portable Avatar (with the ID of the machine). No Text-To-Speech: the Portable Avatar carries the answer as text.",
